{
  "name": "Community · Onboarding and provisioning",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "5c8db0fd-1b30-44e8-a02e-c54d17712077",
      "name": "About this workflow",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -80,
        -220
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 640,
        "height": 230,
        "content": "## Community · Onboarding and provisioning\nWhen a Stripe charge succeeds, reads what was bought, creates or updates the buyer in Supabase, stores a secret code that the Discord bot exchanges for the right roles, and sends a Skool invitation for each community tier in the purchase.\n\n**Platforms:** Stripe, Supabase, Skool\n**Source and tests:** github.com/kimjoshuadr/n8n-workflows · `production/community-provisioning`"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "c1adf2d2-45b7-4aec-af0e-5647a8a584f1",
      "name": "Section: Get checkout details",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -80,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 2200,
        "height": 510,
        "color": 4,
        "content": "## 1. Get checkout details\nThe charge is traced to its checkout and line items, and each line item is sorted into community tiers and bot access."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "5aae1bc0-68ba-430d-a2d6-3d5d8492de10",
      "name": "Section: Data manipulation",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -80,
        590
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 1940,
        "height": 510,
        "color": 5,
        "content": "## 2. Data manipulation\nNew or returning buyer, a fresh secret code, and one record of what this purchase grants."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "263a9591-9307-43d8-ae4b-9841d2dab2e3",
      "name": "Section: Database update and invitations",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -80,
        1180
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 2200,
        "height": 510,
        "color": 6,
        "content": "## 3. Database update and invitations\nThe user is saved, the Discord bot is given its code, and one Skool invitation goes out per tier."
      }
    },
